  "description": "IGONUR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H96 N12 O16 Sm4,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Sm01 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm02 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.620-3.948 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.55-111.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C116H96N12O16Sm4·2(C2H3N). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
